      "cooked": "<p>erpnext sales invoice, on first save, dicount amount showing -49, i am not sure why, please anyone let me know.  Thankyou in advance</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/0/8083d49e495337b7341ef5e9f174c160c9dbe0b5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8083d49e495337b7341ef5e9f174c160c9dbe0b5\" title=\"erpnext sales invoice\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/0/8083d49e495337b7341ef5e9f174c160c9dbe0b5_2_690x162.png\" alt=\"erpnext sales invoice\" data-base62-sha1=\"ikTyPJXlYwP5PaPnPKTKKw6xpuR\" width=\"690\" height=\"162\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/0/8083d49e495337b7341ef5e9f174c160c9dbe0b5_2_690x162.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/0/8083d49e495337b7341ef5e9f174c160c9dbe0b5_2_1035x243.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/0/8083d49e495337b7341ef5e9f174c160c9dbe0b5.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">erpnext sales invoice</span><span class=\"informations\">1366×321 20.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
